## Live per-item Auto-Map results in the Mapping Visual and List tabs

Context:
While a batch Auto-Map ran, the Visual and List tabs only changed when the
whole run completed: the backend published counts per chunk and mappings
reached the session at the end. Operators want to watch each entity /
relationship turn green (mapped) or yellow (partial) as soon as the agent
submits it.

Changes:
1. src/agents/tools/context.py, src/agents/tools/mapping.py
   New optional ``ToolContext.on_mapping(kind, mapping)`` hook fired after
   every accepted ``submit_entity_mapping`` / ``submit_relationship_mapping``.
2. src/agents/agent_auto_assignment/engine.py
   ``run_agent(on_mapping=...)`` forwards the hook into the ToolContext.
3. src/back/objects/mapping/AutoAssignLiveFeed.py (new)
   Accumulates one batch run's mappings (committed per chunk + in-flight
   submissions) and republishes ``task.result`` with
   ``live_entity_mappings`` / ``live_relationship_mappings`` and live counts;
   failed chunks roll back their in-flight items.
4. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   ``run_auto_assign_task`` uses the feed (per-item callback, commit /
   rollback per chunk); ``auto_assign_with_agent`` accepts ``on_mapping``.
5. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-autoassign.js
   ``applyLiveMappings`` merges live items into ``MappingState`` (keeps the
   ``excluded`` flag, skips unchanged items) and repaints; "Run in
   background" is shown during a run; failed / cancelled runs reload the
   server config.
6. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js
   ``entityAttributeStatus`` helper (shared with List), in-place
   ``refreshMappingMapStatus`` (no redraw, zoom/pan kept) and
   ``refreshMappingLiveStatus``; changed items pulse.
7. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-manual.js, mapping-manual.css
   ``refreshLive`` keeps collapsed groups / scroll and pulses changed rows;
   new yellow **Partial** badge for entities missing attribute columns.
8. src/front/static/mapping/css/mapping-design.css
   Pulse animation for just-mapped nodes / relationship handles.
9. src/front/config/menu_config.json, src/front/static/global/js/mapping-core.js
   The Mapping section is no longer disabled during Auto-Map; instead
   ``autoSaveMappings`` refuses to save (with a warning) while a run is active.
10. docs/user-guide.md
    Document live results in Visual / List.
11. Tests: live feed (mid-chunk publish, out-of-chunk filter, failed-chunk
    rollback), ``on_mapping`` hook, front contracts; size baseline tightened.

